Package: gate-ate
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Matthew Wood <mawoodmain@googlemail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-glib-2.0, systemd, udev
Recommends: gnome-shell (>= 46), gnome-shell (<< 51)
Homepage: https://github.com/MAWoodMain/GATE
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Gnome Automatic Test Equipment service and device manager
 Detect and use test equipment from an agent-operated Ubuntu service.
 Provides authenticated local HTTP control, shared-timebase recording,
 a GTK device manager, and a GNOME Shell measurement indicator.
 Initial drivers support Siglent SDS1202X-E and Fluke 45 instruments.
